      "content": "hey so im on ritalin for adhd and finals week is coming up and im super stressed. i feel like the meds aren't quite enough to keep me focused for these long study sessions. would it be okay if i drink like 2 or 3 monster energy drinks a day or maybe take some caffeine pills on top of my dose to help me stay locked in? i just need that extra push to get through the week.",
